  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　りょうりに　つかう\nしょくざいの　いっしゅ。まよった　ときは\nハンバーグを　いれておけば　まちがいない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캠프 요리에 사용되는\n식재료 중 하나. 고민될 때\n햄버그를 넣으면 실패할 일은 없다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作露營料理時使用的食材之一。\n不知道該放什麼的時候，\n放漢堡排就一定不會錯。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient de cuisine pour le camping.\nQuand on ne sait pas quoi ajouter à un curry,\nle steak haché est une valeur sûre.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Zutat für PokéCamping-Mahlzeiten. Mit Frikadellen\nliegt man nie falsch. Die perfekte Zutat für alle Köche,\ndie sich nicht für eine Zutat entscheiden können.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. Una\napuesta segura, perfecta para esos momentos de duda.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno degli ingredienti che puoi usare per cucinare\nin campeggio. Quando non sai bene cosa fare,\naggiungi un Hamburger e non sbagli mai.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the many ingredients that can be used for\ncooking at your camp. If you’re unsure about what to\ncook, you can’t go wrong with some burger.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　料理に　使う\n食材の　一種。迷った　ときは\nハンバーグを　入れておけば　間違いない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在露营营地制作料理时会使用的\n一种食材。不知道该加什么的时候，\n选择这种汉堡肉准没错。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. Una\napuesta segura, perfecta para esos momentos de duda.",
